<div class="tw-foot p">
<div class="fn" id="TFN1"><p id="P44"><em>Notes</em>. The organisms are those studied in ref. (<a href="#R4" class="usa-link" aria-describedby="R4">4</a>) and described in the main text. The parameter interpretations are: <em>F<sub>max</sub></em> = cellular proteome sensitivity to radiation-induced carbonylation; <em>K<sub>dam</sub></em> = yield of DNA DSBs per unit of radiation dose for each radiation type (γ radiation or ultraviolet); <em>K<sub>rep</sub></em> = cellular DSB repair capacity; <em>X</em> = cell (or infective centers) survival sensitivity to protein carbonylation. Details are described in the main text.</p></div>
<div class="fn" id="TFN2">
<sup>a</sup><p class="display-inline" id="P45">Parameter fixed at a value based on the data or on literature sources.</p>
</div>
